Depends: ${shlibs:Depends}, ${misc:Depends}, libssl3
Description: TizenOS Standalone Cryptographic Digital Signature & Verification Utility
 Standalone CLI utility for signing files and verifying digital signatures using
 Ed25519, RSA-4096 PSS, and ECDSA P-256 with OpenSSL 3.0.
